re building the regexes. The error message names the pattern that actually contains the separator.\n- **Test:** I added `test_and_pattern_with_path_separator` in `tests/tests.rs`. It checks that `Foo --and one/two` fails with that message and that the same search still works with `--full-path`. The test fails without the fix and passes with it, and the whole `tests` suite passes (111 tests).\n- **Not checked:** the Windows-only `\\` check now covers `--and` patterns too, but I didn't build or test on Windows.","ttft_ms":2241,"type":"result","duration_ms":88232,"uuid":"c87a84a8-d4c2-4d13-ab78-e2d5aef4f8e4","ttft_stream_ms":1065,"time_to_request_ms":135,"first_content_frame_ms":1065,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
